    seed_jit_typed_optional_holding_user_none_takes_some_arm_2026-11-27, fixing, p3sweep4-20261127, 2026-11-27T19:34:15Z, 2026-11-27T19:34:15Z, open, "wave9"

    seed_jit_typed_optional_holding_user_none_takes_some_arm_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep4-61127: reproduced per engine (enum Q: None | Here(i64); val a: Q? = Q.None; match flat arms): interpreter 0 (None arm, correct), seed JIT 1 (Some arm - the bug); .?/if val/?? presence semantics correct on both. Root cause: a typed Q? slot holds the raw user-enum word; rt_enum_new_none STAMPS it (RT_ENUM_FLAG_NONE_VARIANT, runtime/src/value/objects.rs:528-538); the interpreter reads flat None/nil/Some arms by the payload variant name; the seed JIT's typed-optional fast paths probe nil-sentinel only (hir/lower/expr/control.rs:1382-1396 + stmt_lowering.rs:3838-3852 case None/nil to rt_is_none; optional_some_condition case Some presence-only rt_is_some). rt_is_none_variant (objects.rs:998) already answers all three shapes and is what the merged erased path uses - the typed fast paths were never extended; a pure-runtime fix is impossible because ?? shares rt_is_some and must keep presence semantics. PURE-SIMPLE FIX (in tree, src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLoweringExpr/switch_operators_calls.spl): the Option dual-ABI normalization flat lane now calls rt_is_none_variant with swapped targets (was rt_is_some), plus new enum_constructor_symbol_v1 so None-named user-enum variants construct via rt_enum_new_none at both construction sites. New in-process spec test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_spec.spl 3/3 GREEN on the fresh seed; neighbours nested_optional_text_nil_pattern 7/7, if_val_binder_payload 3/3, option_class_payload_val_match_lowering 3/3. SEED PATCH (verified, preserved): build/p3cache/typednone/seed_typed_none_arm.patch (104 insertions, 2 files: optional_payload_declares_none helper + rt_is_none_variant emission in the typed fast paths), applied and verified in a disposable scratch worktree at tip - JIT byte-identical to the interpreter (u(a)=0, nil_first=2, none_first=0, coalesce=7, ifval=1, dotq=1); regression suites on the patched build: seed_jit_erased_option_some_pattern 19/19, optional_enum_some_variant_match_parity 2/2, jit_nested_option_result_user_none_enum_match 5/5, interpreter_patterns 41/41, hir::lower::tests 459/459. Integration spec test/02_integration/app/run/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_parity_spec.spl (SIMPLE_BINARY-overridable): RED on fresh seed (interpreter ok / jit wrong), GREEN 2/2 on the patched scratch. Patch preserved at doc/08_tracking/bug/evidence/seed_typed_none_arm_2026-11-27.patch (build/ is gitignored) - pending application to hir/lower + the next seed rebuild. Adjacent documented disagreement (owner decision, optional_enum_some_variant_match_engine_divergence_2026-11-14): a non-None payload (Q.Here(3)) falls through flat arms on the interpreter but takes Some on the JIT - the patch fixes exactly the filed case. close_evidence reproducer=test/02_integration/app/run/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_parity_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_spec.spl"
    seed_jit_typed_optional_holding_user_none_takes_some_arm_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep4: reproduced (interpreter None arm correct; seed JIT Some arm). Root cause: typed Q? holds the raw stamped user-enum word; JIT typed-optional flat arms probe nil-sentinel only (hir/lower/expr/control.rs:1382-1396, stmt_lowering.rs:3838-3852, optional_some_condition presence-only rt_is_some) while rt_is_none_variant answers all three shapes; a pure-runtime fix is impossible (?? shares rt_is_some, presence semantics). Pure-Simple fix in switch_operators_calls.spl (flat lane rt_is_none_variant + enum_constructor_symbol_v1 stamping at both construction sites); in-process spec 3/3 GREEN; integration spec typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_parity RED on fresh seed (interpreter ok / jit wrong) to GREEN 2/2 on the patched scratch; patched-build suites 19/19, 2/2, 5/5, 41/41, 459/459. Seed patch (104 insertions, optional_payload_declares_none + rt_is_none_variant emission) verified in a disposable tip worktree then preserved at doc/08_tracking/bug/evidence/seed_typed_none_arm_2026-11-27.patch because build/ is gitignored - pending hir/lower application at the next seed-lane window. Adjacent owner-decision divergence (Q.Here falls through on interpreter, takes Some on JIT) documented, not in scope. close_evidence reproducer=test/02_integration/app/run/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_parity_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/typed_optional_user_none_flat_arm_spec.spl"
